      "author_handle": "bagnall",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 19 years 3 months ago",
      "body": "Hi, I've just launched a new, free website to help people find family friendly places (some with baby changing facilities) local to them. So far it has data for the Cambridge area, but I'm hoping others will contribute locations for other areas too, to help one another. It is BabyChange. Any feedback welcome. Please mention it to other parents with young children too. If you have a website, maybe you could add a link to mine?",
